  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 5.0.0 Alpha 4.2\n\n### Additions\n* Added several Platform classes (including a Platform base class) to represent Platform details\n* Added Platform Provider interfaces as interfaces to provide Platform Details - Implementing classes will replace the ``WindowsOperatingSystem``, ``MacOperatingSystem``, ``LinuxOperatingSystem``, and ``FreeBSDOperatingSystem`` classes respectively in a future PlatformKit 5.0 pre-release version\n* Added PlatformFamily enum to represent Platform families\n\n### Changes\n* Updated CliRunner 1.0.0 Alpha 3 to CliInvoke 1.0.0 now that the name and package have changed\n* Updated System Extensions to 6.0.0\n* Updated  Polyfill to 7.20.0 from 7.16.1\n\n### Removals\n* Removed Windows Registry searching related code - Use the ``Microsoft.Windows.Compatibility`` package if you need this functionality\n* Removed AbstractOperatingSystem - OS Specific Operating System classes will be removed in a future PlatformKit 5 pre-release version once their replacements are ready",
